# Keeps Agate's own machinery out of the agent's searches (ripgrep honors .ignore and .rgignore).
# Explicit reads by path still work: AGENTS.md points to .agate/core/guides/ by path.
# To search them anyway: rg --no-ignore-dot <pattern>, or delete the line you need here.
.agate/
.agents/skills/*/references/
memory/local/.cache/
